      "description": "The Donner is Rheinland doctrine in a launcher: blind the enemy first, then let the guns do the rest. Its capacitor warheads hit with a thunderclap that leaves shields dead and engines stalled.\n\nAn EMP missile. It turns after the target you have selected at up to 166 degrees a second, out to 1000 m, and its pulse drains shields and power while barely scratching a hull. Open a fight with it, then finish the job with your guns.",
