      "description": "Hanabi launchers began as festival fireworks in Kusari workshops, and the same craftsmen still build them. Their pride is in the fuse: a Hanabi round fills the sky with fire and never burns its own.\n\nA swarm launcher. Each round is a volley of 6 rockets that fly straight at 400 m/s and go off on contact or as soon as an enemy is within 12 m, each one hitting everything within 30 m but your friends. Weak against a single ship, made for packs, mine fields and turret clusters. Flares cannot draw it away.",
