      "description": "Junkers build everything out of something else, and the Scrapstorm is a Barrager made out of three. It is ugly, it rattles, and the wrecks it leaves behind are worth picking over: it breaks a ship without spoiling what it carried.\n\nAn Assault gun: a shield gun. It hits a shield in full and a bare hull at 50 %, so it strips shields fast and leaves the hull to a heavier gun. Quick, accurate bolts, cheap on energy: the gun everyone starts with. Full damage out to 75 % of its range, falling to 50 % at the end of it. Made for light fighters and for learning to aim.\n\nA faction's signature gun, the best of its line. No dealer sells it; only these ships' wrecks drop it: Junkers",
